# Styling & i18n

## Styling

- Build UI with Ant Design 6 components; use `theme.useToken()` for design tokens.
- Co-locate component styles in `Feature.css` next to `Feature.jsx`.
- Keep shared layout numbers (spacing, sizes, pagination) in [client/src/constants/ui.js](client/src/constants/ui.js) rather than hardcoding them.

## i18n & Messages

- User-facing UI copy goes through `useTranslation()` with keys in [client/src/i18n/locales/en.json](client/src/i18n/locales/en.json).

```jsx
import { useTranslation } from 'react-i18next'
const { t } = useTranslation()
return <span>{t('blog.comments')}</span>
```

- Toast/error strings used inside API hooks come from `MESSAGES` in [client/src/constants/messages.js](client/src/constants/messages.js).
- Add new UI strings under the appropriate nested key in `en.json`; do not hardcode visible text in components.
